# =============== #
# Playmaker Files #
# =============== #

# Playmaker generates FSMs as assets in the project.
# Do NOT ignore PlayMaker/FsmTemplates/ if you use templates.

# These are temporary files generated during runtime/editing
PlayMaker/Editor/PlayMakerPrefs.asset
PlayMaker/Editor/PlayMakerEditor.asset

# Optional: Ignore FSM saved states (only if you don't use them)
# PlayMaker/Resources/PlayMakerFSMs/*_State.asset

# Ignore generated preview textures
Assets/Gizmos/FsmComponent*Preview*.png

